flowchart TB
 Inventory[Independent inventory with provenance] --> Coverage[Compare identity and revisions]
 Journal[Received source journal] --> Coverage
 Coverage --> Gap[Known delta or unknown denominator]
 Journal --> Accounting[Processing disposition accounting]
 Accounting --> P[Pending / excluded / quarantined / failed / assessed]
 P --> Many[Zero or many candidates; reasons for zero]
 P --> Age[Aged pending = processing gap]
 Grant[Current policy / grant / cancel epoch] --> Claim[Fenced local claim]
 Claim --> Marker[Durable transmit-start marker]
 Stop[Scope stop] --> Grant
 Marker --> Remote[Possible external transmission]
 Remote --> Reconcile[Receipt or reconciliation]
 Reconcile --> Result[Verified outcome or unknown]
 Result --> Comp[Compensation needs a new authorization]
